	quest.7266A51673D0E7F9.quest_desc: [
		"This tutorial will guide you through some basic features. Don't worry, it won't take &otoo &rlong."
		""
		"To start, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New quests will start to appear."
		""
		"If new quests do not start appearing, try rejoining your world. Do not eat the bread until the tutorial is finished!"
	]
	quest.7266A51673D0E7F9.title: "Welcome to &b&lFPBCRAFT New Age&r!"
	quest.72B3B0080A427439.quest_desc: ["With these awesome armor pieces you can &bBounce from place to place&r using your &aSlime Boots&r or &eCling to the ceiling&r with your &aSlime Helmet&r the helmet also allows you to &dBounce off walls&r if you are using an Elytra alongside it"]
