	quest.74702A1045B526D5.title: "Create Nuclear"
	quest.74702A1045B526D5.quest_desc: ["Build a reactor through Create-style material processing. This chapter follows the installed 1.21.1 reactor system, not the newer V2 tier/coolant system."]
	quest.4160C3EF6AFD9B8E.title: "Find Uranium and Lead"
	quest.4160C3EF6AFD9B8E.quest_desc: ["Mine Create Nuclear's deepslate uranium and lead ores. Uranium becomes fuel; lead is used for shielding and reinforced glass."]
	quest.DFEB8449F0D47E82.title: "Make Reactor-Grade Steel"
	quest.DFEB8449F0D47E82.quest_desc: ["Crush coal into Coal Dust, then use Create processing to produce Steel Ingots. Steel is the structural backbone of the reactor."]
	quest.659E43AAD5213009.title: "Lead and Reinforced Glass"
	quest.659E43AAD5213009.quest_desc: ["Refine Lead Ingots and craft Reinforced Glass before handling reactor construction."]
	quest.3DFE429A308F8779.title: "Uranium Powder"
	quest.3DFE429A308F8779.quest_desc: ["Process uranium into Uranium Powder. This is the first dedicated step in the fuel-refining chain."]
	quest.7470D71785D3AB75.title: "Yellowcake"
	quest.7470D71785D3AB75.quest_desc: ["Continue refining Uranium Powder into Yellowcake."]
	quest.958A609FA3306D05.title: "Enriched Yellowcake"
	quest.958A609FA3306D05.quest_desc: ["Enrich Yellowcake for the final fuel-rod processing stage."]
	quest.796095B1E948CEC1.title: "Graphite Rod"
	quest.796095B1E948CEC1.quest_desc: ["Craft Graphite Rods for the reactor input and blueprint configuration."]
	quest.511929D9CBC6E1AD.title: "Uranium Fuel Rod"
	quest.511929D9CBC6E1AD.quest_desc: ["Turn enriched uranium material into Uranium Rods. These are the reactor's fuel."]
	quest.C188DFA35FC8C9F5.title: "Radiation Protection"
	quest.C188DFA35FC8C9F5.quest_desc: ["Make Anti-Radiation Boots and inspect the rest of the armor recipes before operating around nuclear material."]
	quest.2A705C38DBA7685D.title: "Reactor Casing"
	quest.2A705C38DBA7685D.quest_desc: ["Apply Steel to Brass Casings to make Reactor Casings. Most reactor components build outward from this block."]
	quest.0CDB5C08B1DC60FA.title: "Input and Output"
	quest.0CDB5C08B1DC60FA.quest_desc: ["Build Reactor Input and Reactor Output blocks. The input accepts uranium/graphite rods; the output exposes the generated rotational power."]
	quest.41DA3A39873580D1.title: "Core, Frame, and Cooler"
	quest.41DA3A39873580D1.quest_desc: ["Craft the Reactor Frame, Reactor Core, and Reactor Cooler. These form the functional internal structure around the controller."]
	quest.3999E4356A525276.title: "Reactor Controller"
	quest.3999E4356A525276.quest_desc: ["Craft the controller that manages reactor power generation. The recipe requires a Nether Star, intentionally making the Wither part of reactor progression."]
	quest.9AE9256F8468C0CE.title: "Configure the Reactor Blueprint"
	quest.9AE9256F8468C0CE.quest_desc: ["Use the Reactor Blueprint to define the internal rod arrangement. Load the required uranium and graphite rods and confirm the intended layout before activation."]
	quest.71C545D4DFA6A2E4.title: "First Criticality"
	quest.71C545D4DFA6A2E4.quest_desc: ["Assemble the multiblock, load the input, activate the controller, and verify the reactor produces stable rotational output before connecting a factory."]
	quest.3443854D13E924A0.title: "Automate the Fuel Cycle"
	quest.3443854D13E924A0.quest_desc: ["Automate uranium processing and rod supply with Create machinery. Design the line so you can stop fuel delivery without dismantling the reactor."]
	quest.192B13B1593CDA30.title: "Welcome to Power Grid"
	quest.192B13B1593CDA30.quest_desc: ["Power Grid simulates real electrical circuits. Current needs a closed loop, voltage drops under load, and poorly designed equipment can overheat. Start small and use Ponder often."]
	quest.45FBE37DA49B29B5.title: "Wire a Closed Loop"
	quest.45FBE37DA49B29B5.quest_desc: ["Make insulated copper wire. Your first goal is a complete source-to-load-and-back circuit rather than a one-ended FE cable."]
	quest.5F338AF618811A0B.title: "Switch a Light"
	quest.5F338AF618811A0B.quest_desc: ["Build a simple low-voltage circuit with a switch and light bulb. Confirm that opening the switch actually breaks the circuit."]
	quest.ADCCFEE584182F54.title: "Measure Before Guessing"
	quest.ADCCFEE584182F54.quest_desc: ["Use the Multimeter to inspect voltage and current. Measure at the source and again near the load so voltage drop becomes visible."]
	quest.DE27DD7CAB17DC66.title: "Store Electrical Energy"
	quest.DE27DD7CAB17DC66.quest_desc: ["Add a battery as a controllable source/storage element for a small test circuit."]
	quest.D28A4EF5A79CB67D.title: "Build a Generator"
	quest.D28A4EF5A79CB67D.quest_desc: ["Assemble the generator components and drive them with Create rotational power. Electricity generation should be sized for the load you plan to connect."]
	quest.2B4DA1F76EAF7FF1.title: "Watch the Grid"
	quest.2B4DA1F76EAF7FF1.quest_desc: ["Install a Power Gauge where it is easy to read. Use measurements to catch overloads and unstable voltage before equipment is damaged."]
	quest.AAC72AFBD591E5C0.title: "Electricity Back to Rotation"
	quest.AAC72AFBD591E5C0.quest_desc: ["Use an Electric Motor to convert electrical power back into Create rotational power. Compare its demand with your generator's available supply."]
	quest.3BB73E10433397A2.title: "Transform the Voltage"
	quest.3BB73E10433397A2.quest_desc: ["Build a transformer and use it to step voltage to a level appropriate for transmission or machinery. Higher voltage can reduce line losses, but requires proper equipment."]
	quest.DEF24C083D3FBEEB.title: "Protect the Circuit"
	quest.DEF24C083D3FBEEB.quest_desc: ["Add a Fuse Holder and Grounding Rod. Treat protection as part of the design, not an afterthought after something overheats."]
	quest.7E6E77890C42CC5A.title: "Build a Distribution Backbone"
	quest.7E6E77890C42CC5A.quest_desc: ["Move into heavier connectors and HV switching for a larger network. Keep high-voltage distribution separate from low-voltage control where practical."]
	quest.7EAA39628888424A.title: "Add Solar Generation"
	quest.7EAA39628888424A.quest_desc: ["Add a Solar Panel as a second generation source and observe how the grid behaves as generation changes."]
	quest.E3E7FA0773698FD4.title: "Bridge Forge Energy"
	quest.E3E7FA0773698FD4.quest_desc: ["Use the FE Inverter when you need to interface Power Grid with FE-based machines. Keep the physics-based grid understandable instead of hiding every load behind FE conversion."]
	quest.40906C6BCDE424F9.title: "Design a Circuit Board"
	quest.40906C6BCDE424F9.quest_desc: ["Use the Circuit Design Table and Circuit Board system to move from simple wiring into compact custom control circuits."]
	quest.58FDAB779E341AA6.title: "Operate a Real Grid"
	quest.58FDAB779E341AA6.quest_desc: ["Run multiple loads from a shared generation/distribution network. Measure voltage at several points, switch a major load on and off, and make sure the grid remains stable."]
	quest.4E387D2F5A72F4EE.title: "Create Ore Excavation"
	quest.4E387D2F5A72F4EE.quest_desc: ["Locate hidden infinite ore veins and fluid reservoirs, then build rotationally powered extraction machines over the correct chunk."]
	quest.07EAFAB80CF38221.title: "Create Big Cannons"
	quest.07EAFAB80CF38221.quest_desc: ["Learn the production and assembly tools for large cannons. Use Ponder on cannon components before committing expensive materials."]
	quest.0D32E9864B678D9D.title: "Prepare a Drill"
	quest.0D32E9864B678D9D.quest_desc: ["Craft the standard drill component used in ore-extraction machinery."]
	quest.6C31C7A3809392C1.title: "Upgrade the Drill"
	quest.6C31C7A3809392C1.quest_desc: ["Upgrade to the Diamond Drill for the veins that require stronger extraction tooling."]
	quest.61649F53A2D84AA5.title: "Extract Fluid Reservoirs"
	quest.61649F53A2D84AA5.quest_desc: ["Use the Fluid Extractor for hidden fluid reservoirs discovered with the Vein Finder."]
	quest.672DA4C375EB325D.title: "Ram the Cannon"
	quest.672DA4C375EB325D.quest_desc: ["Keep a Ram Rod available while learning manual cannon loading and maintenance."]
	quest.B267C5BD511C52C7.title: "Inspect Block Armor"
	quest.B267C5BD511C52C7.quest_desc: ["Use the Block Armor Inspection Tool to understand what your cannon is expected to penetrate before spending ammunition."]
	quest.8942AC3C8F25CBE7.title: "Electric Motor"
	quest.8942AC3C8F25CBE7.quest_desc: ["Convert Forge Energy back into Create rotational power with the Electric Motor."]
	quest.0476DA101D0EDB46.title: "Capacitor"
	quest.0476DA101D0EDB46.quest_desc: ["Add a Capacitor to the Crafts and Additions electrical toolkit and inspect its uses in EMI."]
	quest.7C51313A8F84959F.title: "Portable Energy Interface"
	quest.7C51313A8F84959F.quest_desc: ["Transfer Forge Energy to and from moving Create contraptions using the Portable Energy Interface."]
	quest.01B3C841225829B3.quest_desc: ["Add a Button Module for discrete cockpit commands alongside analog flight controls."]
	quest.01B3C841225829B3.title: "Button Module"
	quest.074CB36FB41FB4DB.quest_desc: ["Place an Advanced Display where travelers can read it and configure it for useful station or departure information."]
	quest.074CB36FB41FB4DB.title: "Install Passenger Information"
	quest.0922AF692CC1EE68.title: "Railway Navigator"
	quest.0DA4BC1BC034EE69.quest_desc: ["Craft the Brass tier when one chunk is not enough. It also needs a captured Ghast before becoming active."]
	quest.0DA4BC1BC034EE69.title: "Empty Brass Chunk Loader"
	quest.0EB54DBB3540331E.title: "Track Crossing"
	quest.12B91215BFFF67CA.title: "Railway Infrastructure"
	quest.151735352C6318F1.quest_desc: ["Make a single-use vehicle container for one-way transport jobs where you do not need a reusable portable container."]
	quest.151735352C6318F1.title: "Disposable Vehicle Container"
	quest.16A90A131D040D60.quest_desc: ["Use throwable and mounted rope tools to catch, connect, and dock moving physical structures without relying on perfect block alignment."]
	quest.16A90A131D040D60.title: "Docking and Rope"
	quest.16B62072743D8EA9.title: "Bank Terminal"
	quest.1A1D03622DC034D0.title: "Sale Point"
	quest.1B5EB49F9665F261.title: "Train Station Clock"
	quest.1CCDF34CE09BCB46.quest_desc: ["Install a Joystick, stabilization/control hardware, and at least one auxiliary control on a test vehicle. Verify every axis and command while the craft is still easy to recover."]
	quest.1CCDF34CE09BCB46.title: "Build a Working Cockpit"
	quest.24940F7B57274AA0.quest_desc: ["Plan a real trip with the Navigator and follow the suggested connection. Fix ambiguous station names or schedules you notice while traveling."]
	quest.24940F7B57274AA0.title: "Take a Planned Connection"
	quest.2560A19BA65ABA14.quest_desc: ["Craft the survival Structure Tool. This is the main interface for blueprinting, transforming, welding, disconnecting, deleting, and changing collision on physical structures."]
	quest.2560A19BA65ABA14.title: "Survival Structure Tool"
	quest.2677A9AF029E5C8F.quest_desc: ["Power the Andesite loader, leave the area, and verify a simple machine continues operating. Keep this single-chunk tier for small stationary jobs."]
	quest.2677A9AF029E5C8F.title: "Test a Loaded Chunk"
	quest.2C2E9669B7CF255F.quest_desc: ["Build passenger-facing navigation and station infrastructure on top of your Create railway network."]
	quest.2C2E9669B7CF255F.title: "Railway Services"
	quest.2D420E7E1408CA7B.title: "Throwable Rope Connector"
	quest.2EB06B243632753B.quest_desc: ["Craft a Portable Structure Container so a saved vehicle can be carried and reconstructed without keeping the original vehicle loaded."]
	quest.2EB06B243632753B.title: "Portable Structure Container"
	quest.31DB3E9F67A747D7.quest_desc: ["Use Translate or Rotate on a test structure, then try Weld or Simple Weld between two physical structures. Use Disconnect to remove a connection deliberately."]
	quest.31DB3E9F67A747D7.title: "Edit Physical Structures"
	quest.33F9DA1C941929AF.title: "Rope Connector Launcher"
	quest.363407846CCC1EA6.quest_desc: ["Grab a physical structure with the Magnetic Gun, move it, rotate it, try precision control, and release it safely. Learn this before attempting tight docking maneuvers."]
	quest.363407846CCC1EA6.title: "Move and Rotate a Craft"
	quest.3683846711D353BF.quest_desc: ["Test No Collision mode on two harmless physical structures. Re-enable normal collision when finished; collision changes can make docking easier but can also hide mistakes."]
	quest.3683846711D353BF.title: "Control Structure Collision"
	quest.39FE1634844E05B3.title: "Mounted Rope Launcher"
	quest.3AECA3B3FE42AB1D.quest_desc: ["Craft a Control Stand as a compact cockpit mounting point for Aeroworks controls."]
	quest.3AECA3B3FE42AB1D.title: "Control Stand"
	quest.3B114CD43935DC08.title: "Banking Guide"
	quest.3DD13D4904BFA026.quest_desc: ["Install the mounted launcher on a vehicle or dock and test a repeatable capture/retrieval workflow before depending on it during travel."]
	quest.3DD13D4904BFA026.title: "Use a Mounted Rope Launcher"
	quest.3FA8BB65BB34118F.quest_desc: ["Numismatics provides player-facing banking and shop tools. It belongs with shared storage/services rather than railway progression."]
	quest.3FA8BB65BB34118F.title: "Player Economy"
	quest.41B7B3C582FE60E2.quest_desc: ["Open the value panel and test the 1x1, 3x3, and 5x5 settings. Leave it on the smallest range that actually covers the machinery you need."]
	quest.41B7B3C582FE60E2.title: "Configure the Smallest Useful Range"
	quest.44094CDFD2CAF677.quest_desc: ["Assemble a Brass loader onto a moving or stationary contraption. On contraptions it loads a 3x3 area and does not need rotational power once assembled. Test its contraption-control behavior as well."]
	quest.44094CDFD2CAF677.title: "Keep a Contraption Loaded"
	quest.453DC602E5FD4DEF.title: "Gyroscope"
	quest.4A6A53BC7E9D6D23.quest_desc: ["FPBcraft also includes Grappling Hook Mod: Skybound, which can hook onto Create contraptions and Sable/Create Aeronautics vehicles. Use it to board or recover onto a moving craft. Its full upgrade path is covered later in Combat and Equipment."]
	quest.4A6A53BC7E9D6D23.title: "Board a Moving Airship"
	quest.4AFF5FE1E7F3D01A.quest_desc: ["Run a train through the crossing and any added station infrastructure before connecting it to a busy main line. Verify signals, clearances, and route names from both directions."]
	quest.4AFF5FE1E7F3D01A.title: "Test Railway Infrastructure"
	quest.4DFC4C8F8215830C.quest_desc: ["Open the Survival Structure Tool interface and review Save, Load, Delete, No Collision, Weld, Simple Weld, Translate, Rotate, and Disconnect before editing an important craft."]
	quest.4DFC4C8F8215830C.title: "Learn the Tool Modes"
	quest.517A13A858670888.quest_desc: ["Right-click a Ghast with the empty chunk loader to capture it and turn the loader into its active form. Do this somewhere you can safely control the Ghast encounter."]
	quest.517A13A858670888.title: "Capture a Ghast"
	quest.522AD32AD04CEB2F.quest_desc: ["Use the Navigator to search between two stations. Group station platforms that belong to the same stop and choose names that make sense to another player."]
	quest.522AD32AD04CEB2F.title: "Map the Network"
	quest.5B6BAE566FBC39BC.quest_desc: ["Keep important machines, trains, and moving contraptions active beyond player view. Chunk loading is powerful on a multiplayer server, so use the smallest area that solves the problem."]
	quest.5B6BAE566FBC39BC.title: "Create: Power Loader"
	quest.5C62F9E7E06BFFFC.title: "Advanced Display"
	quest.5D16915F16C1BE46.quest_desc: ["Aeroworks adds cockpit controls and stabilization parts for piloting physical vehicles. Build the controls on a simple test craft before wiring a full airship."]
	quest.5D16915F16C1BE46.title: "Aeroworks Controls"
	quest.5DD91F49DE7AC8EC.quest_desc: ["The Brass loader can cover a configurable 1x1, 3x3, or 5x5 area. Larger ranges need higher rotational speed when used as a stationary block."]
	quest.5DD91F49DE7AC8EC.title: "Brass Chunk Loader"
	quest.5F2923D112C7A521.quest_desc: ["The survival Magnetic Gun can grab physical structures for careful repositioning. Practice with a small craft before using it near docks or other vehicles."]
	quest.5F2923D112C7A521.title: "Magnetic Gun"
	quest.6020D4E9158EBD6B.quest_desc: ["Load or print the saved blueprint in a clear area. Verify the vehicle, block-entity data, ropes, wires, constraints, and connected sublevels survived before deleting the original."]
	quest.6020D4E9158EBD6B.title: "Print the Vehicle Again"
	quest.61BBFFD8E76ABFBA.quest_desc: ["Save and restore a vehicle that contains more than one sublevel or supported moving components. Confirm important contraptions, constraints, wires, ropes, and block-entity data behave correctly after restoration."]
	quest.61BBFFD8E76ABFBA.title: "Preserve a Complex Vehicle"
	quest.6292460DB23E5221.quest_desc: ["Craft the empty Andesite loader. Before it can load chunks, it needs a captured Ghast in its portal core."]
	quest.6292460DB23E5221.title: "Empty Andesite Chunk Loader"
	quest.64531F329E19756F.quest_desc: ["Add an Andesite Depositor as a Create-friendly way to move currency into your banking setup. Use EMI to inspect its exact interactions in this pack."]
	quest.64531F329E19756F.title: "Andesite Depositor"
	quest.6519A08C5E0DABB5.quest_desc: ["Put a Brass loader on a train and verify the train remains active outside normal player simulation distance. Use this only on trains that genuinely need unattended operation."]
	quest.6519A08C5E0DABB5.title: "Keep a Train Loaded"
	quest.6912BAE1F6715D30.title: "Control Desk"
	quest.6B77226A091CC501.quest_desc: ["Place a Brass loader next to a Train Station in the correct orientation. The station attachment loads a 3x3 area while a train is present and unloads it after the train departs."]
	quest.6B77226A091CC501.title: "Attach a Loader to a Station"
	quest.6D1A61642339F2C4.quest_desc: ["Configure a Sale Point for a low-risk item and test the full purchase flow with a friend before stocking valuable goods."]
	quest.6D1A61642339F2C4.title: "Open a Small Shop"
	quest.7169D197E32CB6CE.quest_desc: ["Review the loaders you left running. Prefer single chunks and station-triggered loading where possible, and remove loaders that no longer serve an active machine or route."]
	quest.7169D197E32CB6CE.title: "Chunk Loading Without Regret"
	quest.71A4F77CE44A4079.title: "Joystick"
	quest.75D2ABAF81B76874.quest_desc: ["Practice catching and bringing two small physical structures together with the rope launcher. Approach slowly and leave enough room for collision and constraint behavior."]
	quest.75D2ABAF81B76874.title: "Dock Two Moving Structures"
	quest.7A259EC18BFAC41C.quest_desc: ["The Andesite loader keeps its current chunk loaded when supplied with enough rotational power. It unloads after a short delay when power is lost."]
	quest.7A259EC18BFAC41C.title: "Andesite Chunk Loader"
	quest.7B4C52AD367C6D2A.quest_desc: ["Use Save mode on a small Sable or Create Aeronautics vehicle. Start with something expendable so you can learn how connected sublevels are captured safely."]
	quest.7B4C52AD367C6D2A.title: "Save a Vehicle Blueprint"
	chapter.27AC45BF67882B5D.title: "Farmer's Delight"
	chapter.314D0E1200000001.title: "Immortalers Delight"
	chapter.24588CE3822D1A5E.title: "Create Kitchen"
	chapter.314D0E1200000002.title: "Delight Addons"
	chapter.723CD0BDFFF3D894.title: "Underwater Engineering"
	chapter.314D0E1200000011.title: "Tide Fishing"
	chapter.314D0E1200000012.title: "Aquamirae"
	chapter.314D0E1200000013.title: "Myths of the Sea"
	chapter.314D0E1200000014.title: "Aquariums"
	quest.6B26BDD04CD60943.title: "Farmer's Delight"
	quest.6B26BDD04CD60943.quest_desc: ["Grow the core crops, learn ingredient preparation, then master the Skillet, Stove and Cooking Pot. Create-based automation is kept on the separate Create Kitchen page."]
	quest.4B68AE39361B67C5.title: "Cabbage"
	quest.4B68AE39361B67C5.quest_desc: ["Find Cabbage Seeds from wild crops or village farms and establish a renewable farmland patch."]
	quest.29A8D56840D2ABA7.title: "Tomatoes"
	quest.29A8D56840D2ABA7.quest_desc: ["Find Tomato Seeds and grow Tomatoes. Tomato vines are useful for compact farms and many recipes."]
	quest.187A2806F0F6DE96.title: "Onions"
	quest.187A2806F0F6DE96.quest_desc: ["Onions act as both harvest and planting item. Establish a reliable farmland patch for savory recipes."]
	quest.73F98D125FF6BB64.title: "Rice"
	quest.73F98D125FF6BB64.quest_desc: ["Rice needs a shallow-water growing setup rather than ordinary dry farmland. Build a small paddy and harvest enough to cook with."]
	quest.4C04C08F5E39A2FF.title: "Cutting Board"
	quest.4C04C08F5E39A2FF.quest_desc: ["Use a Cutting Board with knives and other tools to turn ingredients into cuts and recipe components."]
	quest.6A24580EECB10EA3.title: "A Good Knife"
	quest.6A24580EECB10EA3.quest_desc: ["Knives unlock many Cutting Board recipes and useful harvesting interactions."]
	quest.9BE12F9CD8FB4D04.title: "Skillet"
	quest.9BE12F9CD8FB4D04.quest_desc: ["Use the Skillet for direct frying and quick meals."]
	quest.43FA7F5302F72B4F.title: "Stove"
	quest.43FA7F5302F72B4F.quest_desc: ["Build a Farmer's Delight Stove as a reliable heat source for the Cooking Pot."]
	quest.67775101CE48D0E2.title: "Cooking Pot"
	quest.67775101CE48D0E2.quest_desc: ["Use a heated Cooking Pot for soups, stews and composed meals."]
	quest.6B0F71C4ED462CA4.title: "Cook Rice"
	quest.6B0F71C4ED462CA4.quest_desc: ["Use your rice harvest in a simple cooked-rice recipe."]
	quest.2C2A35F6C12BF9F1.title: "Make Cabbage Rolls"
	quest.2C2A35F6C12BF9F1.quest_desc: ["Turn cabbage into a composed meal instead of treating crops as checklist items."]
	quest.1DC083B919D8CB9E.title: "Make Beef Stew"
	quest.1DC083B919D8CB9E.quest_desc: ["Cook a representative multi-ingredient stew."]
	quest.40F9425448D9450B.title: "Immortalers Delight"
	quest.40F9425448D9450B.quest_desc: ["Ancient plants are largely discovered through Sniffer exploration. Each crop has its own habitat or cultivation rule, then feeds into specialized ancient cooking."]
	quest.39D833BB8E941A51.title: "Find a Sniffer Egg"
	quest.39D833BB8E941A51.quest_desc: ["Immortalers Delight ruins can help you obtain a Sniffer Egg. A Sniffer is central to discovering ancient crops."]
	quest.3907A9AD5DE769E9.title: "Sniffer Fur Brush"
	quest.3907A9AD5DE769E9.quest_desc: ["Craft the durable Sniffer Fur Brush for archaeology and ancient-crop exploration."]
	quest.6AD6395144AA7C6B.title: "Evolutcorn"
	quest.6AD6395144AA7C6B.quest_desc: ["Have a Sniffer dig in plains, then plant Evolutcorn on farmland."]
	quest.583DCAC285421ADE.title: "Pearlip"
	quest.583DCAC285421ADE.quest_desc: ["Have a Sniffer search jungle terrain. Pearlip grows into a tall fruiting plant on soil-like blocks."]
	quest.7B44ADDA54A7A7BD.title: "Himekaido"
	quest.7B44ADDA54A7A7BD.quest_desc: ["Sniff in forest biomes for Himekaido Seed; it begins as a shrub and can develop into a larger fruiting tree."]
	quest.67AFAA46612A0105.title: "Leisamboo"
	quest.67AFAA46612A0105.quest_desc: ["Search river environments. Leisamboo is aquatic and is planted on a soil-like block one block below the water surface."]
	quest.5DB6B17FE140F17C.title: "Kwat Wheat"
	quest.5DB6B17FE140F17C.quest_desc: ["Sniff in the Crimson Forest. Kwat Wheat grows on farmland, soul sand or soul soil and mature plants can release dangerous gas."]
	quest.19C1D8B184A05125.title: "Alfalfa"
	quest.19C1D8B184A05125.quest_desc: ["Alfalfa Seeds can be found through Sniffer digging in many terrains and grow normally on farmland."]
	quest.58424E33722E8E37.title: "Warped Laurel"
	quest.58424E33722E8E37.quest_desc: ["Search the Warped Forest. Warped Laurel can grow on farmland or soul sand; the soul-sand variant has a special water interaction."]
	quest.1B9391CCDD9BC2E3.title: "Ancient Stove"
	quest.1B9391CCDD9BC2E3.quest_desc: ["Use the Ancient Stove for Immortalers Delight's heat-based food preparation."]
	quest.26D6139235E840E1.title: "Enchantal Cooler"
	quest.26D6139235E840E1.quest_desc: ["Use the Enchantal Cooler for its separate cold/preparation recipe category."]
	quest.6CF46E20B3D1B493.title: "Kwat Tofu Stew"
	quest.6CF46E20B3D1B493.quest_desc: ["Cook a representative Kwat Wheat dish."]
	quest.6E112360801FF0E8.title: "Leisamboo Tea"
	quest.6E112360801FF0E8.quest_desc: ["Process Leisamboo into tea and explore the beverage side of the mod."]
	quest.1932B311790D7B07.title: "Alfalfa Porridge"
	quest.1932B311790D7B07.quest_desc: ["Cook a simple Alfalfa dish."]
	quest.7A31C33041F7A606.title: "Rusty Ancient Blade"
	quest.7A31C33041F7A606.quest_desc: ["Recover the Rusty Ancient Blade as an optional ancient-equipment branch."]
	quest.17916F65A43E8FF3.title: "Ancient Blade Newly Whetted"
	quest.17916F65A43E8FF3.quest_desc: ["Restore the Ancient Blade into its sharpened form."]
	quest.7E7A92C196C65603.title: "Delight Addons"
	quest.7E7A92C196C65603.quest_desc: ["FPBcraft contains several Farmer's Delight addons. Sample their distinct recipe families rather than completing every food."]
	quest.12BD42304D81C2B9.title: "Fugu Roll"
	quest.12BD42304D81C2B9.quest_desc: ["Use Ocean's Delight to turn ocean catches into food."]
	quest.45840D11383C3D7B.title: "Guardian Soup"
	quest.45840D11383C3D7B.quest_desc: ["Try a more unusual Ocean's Delight recipe."]
	quest.92E4C1EE435C97FD.title: "Crab Bisque"
	quest.92E4C1EE435C97FD.quest_desc: ["Use Crabber's Delight for shellfish-focused cooking."]
	quest.3C9945B82C422643.title: "Turtle Stew"
	quest.3C9945B82C422643.quest_desc: ["Try another Crabber's Delight recipe family."]
	quest.2F23BBA907338F3F.title: "From Catch to Dinner"
	quest.2F23BBA907338F3F.quest_desc: ["Turn something from a fishing or sea-exploration trip into a meal from a Delight addon."]
	quest.48FF4CD992D8B3D9.title: "Chef's Delight"
	quest.48FF4CD992D8B3D9.quest_desc: ["Browse Chef's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.13421596ED9374BE.title: "Crate Delight"
	quest.13421596ED9374BE.quest_desc: ["Browse Crate Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.2344F2841723F787.title: "Miner's Delight"
	quest.2344F2841723F787.quest_desc: ["Browse Miner's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.5AD15B7E62A3F1A6.title: "End's Delight"
	quest.5AD15B7E62A3F1A6.quest_desc: ["Browse End's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.46F6A348B6716640.title: "My Nether's Delight"
	quest.46F6A348B6716640.quest_desc: ["Browse My Nether's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.40C3179283FC3399.title: "Rustic Delight"
	quest.40C3179283FC3399.quest_desc: ["Browse Rustic Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.4A4A0DBD9DA973B7.title: "Storage Delight"
	quest.4A4A0DBD9DA973B7.quest_desc: ["Browse Storage Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.281BD363F284F932.title: "Underwater Engineering"
	quest.281BD363F284F932.quest_desc: ["Build and test a Create submarine close to shore before using it for deep-sea expeditions."]
	quest.1C8C1A28A1695E83.title: "Tide Fishing"
	quest.1C8C1A28A1695E83.quest_desc: ["Tide adds a fishing minigame, customizable rods, many habitats and a journal that records fish when you actually catch them."]
	quest.5B31509FFB46D929.title: "Fishing Journal"
	quest.5B31509FFB46D929.quest_desc: ["Use the Journal to track caught species, habitats, biggest catches and completion progress."]
	quest.7501DDA36D5FF32C.title: "Catch Your First Tide Fish"
	quest.7501DDA36D5FF32C.quest_desc: ["Complete Tide's fishing minigame: right-click while the indicator is inside the colored region."]
	quest.54924E3279F3ACDF.title: "Angling Table"
	quest.54924E3279F3ACDF.quest_desc: ["Use the Angling Table to combine hooks, lines and bobbers on a fishing rod."]
	quest.1E791C43CB853A5D.title: "Try Bait"
	quest.1E791C43CB853A5D.quest_desc: ["Add Bait to speed fishing or provide special bonuses."]
	quest.72DF1F00E2E8D5D7.title: "Change the Hook"
	quest.72DF1F00E2E8D5D7.quest_desc: ["Install a hook, then inspect specialized hook effects in EMI."]
	quest.6B36B9EC734FFD3D.title: "Upgrade the Line"
	quest.6B36B9EC734FFD3D.quest_desc: ["Install a fishing line and inspect stronger material tiers."]
	quest.1B68E5AF081A8F5A.title: "Build Your Own Rod"
	quest.1B68E5AF081A8F5A.quest_desc: ["Combine a hook, line and bobber at the Angling Table, then test the rod."]
	quest.32A3F067AEC41928.title: "Depth Meter"
	quest.32A3F067AEC41928.quest_desc: ["Use the Depth Meter while scouting fish habitats."]
	quest.537C7A168C9B7B0D.title: "Climate Gauge"
	quest.537C7A168C9B7B0D.quest_desc: ["Use the Climate Gauge to understand environmental conditions relevant to fish habitats."]
	quest.2E09F648012A5989.title: "Weather Radio"
	quest.2E09F648012A5989.quest_desc: ["Carry the Weather Radio when targeting condition-sensitive catches."]
	quest.6CC8BDCE66C1A34E.title: "Fish Finder"
	quest.6CC8BDCE66C1A34E.quest_desc: ["Use the Fish Finder alongside the Journal when hunting a specific catch."]
	quest.3B7FDEA8E83ECFFF.title: "Fish Satchel"
	quest.3B7FDEA8E83ECFFF.quest_desc: ["Carry catches without turning every fishing trip into inventory management."]
	quest.723BEC43902EA0EE.title: "Fish More Than One Habitat"
	quest.723BEC43902EA0EE.quest_desc: ["Catch fish from several distinct environments and use the Journal to plan where to go next."]
	quest.6EC9063BF3120BF2.title: "Specialized Fishing Rod"
	quest.6EC9063BF3120BF2.quest_desc: ["Craft a Crystal Fishing Rod as an optional milestone."]
	quest.6C1FB9E2125648CE.title: "Bring a Fish Home Alive"
	quest.6C1FB9E2125648CE.quest_desc: ["Use Tide's bucketable fish support to bring a live catch home for an aquarium."]
	quest.4981D51AAAC7558C.title: "Aquamirae"
	quest.4981D51AAAC7558C.quest_desc: ["Explore the Ice Maze and Ship Graveyard as a full expedition with navigation, salvage, equipment and dangerous encounters."]
	quest.645B6465697F8BF3.title: "Echo Compass"
	quest.645B6465697F8BF3.quest_desc: ["Use the Echo Compass to begin the Ship Graveyard progression."]
	quest.1C11995A1A04DDC7.title: "Reach the Ship Graveyard"
	quest.1C11995A1A04DDC7.quest_desc: ["Prepare underwater breathing, recovery supplies and a route home, then reach the frozen Ship Graveyard."]
	quest.3A5919C9C6A4E070.title: "Ship Graveyard Echo"
	quest.3A5919C9C6A4E070.quest_desc: ["Recover a Ship Graveyard Echo, a central progression material."]
	quest.18ECF76DB65AFB34.title: "Abyssal Amethyst"
	quest.18ECF76DB65AFB34.quest_desc: ["Obtain Abyssal Amethyst and inspect the gear recipes it unlocks."]
	quest.28D09AB64485C1CC.title: "Abyssal Armor"
	quest.28D09AB64485C1CC.quest_desc: ["Assemble the full Abyssal armor set as an optional deep-exploration milestone."]
	quest.2AC8A904C5C9F3E9.title: "Rune of the Storm"
	quest.2AC8A904C5C9F3E9.quest_desc: ["Find the ancient Rune of the Storm in the frozen depths."]
	quest.B312FF4DC96B64DA.title: "Dreadwake"
	quest.B312FF4DC96B64DA.quest_desc: ["Obtain Dreadwake as one of Aquamirae's notable abyssal weapons."]
	quest.59988C4BFF1D9775.title: "Terrible Chakram"
	quest.59988C4BFF1D9775.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Terrible Chakram and learn its ranged returning behavior."]
	quest.46E1F7333890AC05.title: "Survive the Mother of the Maze"
	quest.46E1F7333890AC05.quest_desc: ["Encounter the Mother of the Maze. The dedicated Bosses section will later own the explicit guided kill quest."]
	quest.1961ABE88CC367DB.title: "Maze Rose"
	quest.1961ABE88CC367DB.quest_desc: ["After defeating the Maze Mother on the Boss Progression page, keep the Maze Rose as the tangible Ice Maze completion trophy."]
	quest.5551333BF6400CD0.title: "Shell Horn"
	quest.5551333BF6400CD0.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Shell Horn and inspect its role in later Aquamirae progression."]
	quest.7501E48CE11CE1A1.title: "Cornelia's Legacy"
	quest.7501E48CE11CE1A1.quest_desc: ["After defeating Captain Cornelia on the Boss Progression page, obtain Tidepiercer to complete her Aquamirae equipment branch."]
	quest.58A3C4D8F0B52DF9.title: "Myths of the Sea"
	quest.58A3C4D8F0B52DF9.quest_desc: ["Explore oceans and wetlands for mythological creatures. This page is about discovery; major boss kills are reserved for the Bosses section."]
	quest.14456E2BEBDA5C12.title: "Watch the Coasts"
	quest.14456E2BEBDA5C12.quest_desc: ["Explore ocean coasts for creatures such as the Bake Kujira."]
	quest.39DC63457BF89ED8.title: "Something in the Swamp"
	quest.39DC63457BF89ED8.quest_desc: ["Search swamps for the aggressive Bunyip."]
	quest.773EEADF225D02FD.title: "Warm-Ocean Wildlife"
	quest.773EEADF225D02FD.quest_desc: ["Explore warm oceans for creatures such as the Abaia."]
	quest.628E73F28E542E3E.title: "Find a Hippocampus"
	quest.628E73F28E542E3E.quest_desc: ["Locate a Hippocampus and investigate its traversal or taming mechanics."]
	quest.74DCAEFEE72B2873.title: "Leviathan Territory"
	quest.74DCAEFEE72B2873.quest_desc: ["Locate the cold-ocean territory of a Leviathan without requiring the kill here."]
	quest.6AD3AF711015FA06.title: "The Deep-Ocean Kraken"
	quest.6AD3AF711015FA06.quest_desc: ["Find signs of a Kraken in deep ocean and prepare an escape plan."]
	quest.1EBB83B2F1EF9DD3.title: "Aquariums"
	quest.1EBB83B2F1EF9DD3.quest_desc: ["Use Better Fishtanks to turn live catches into a display and husbandry project."]
	quest.00F533B24884272C.title: "Aquarist Guide"
	quest.00F533B24884272C.quest_desc: ["Read the Better Fishtanks guide before choosing tank size, fish and equipment."]
	quest.784568DA925E8116.title: "Aquarist Table"
	quest.784568DA925E8116.quest_desc: ["Build the Aquarist Table as the entry point for aquarium equipment."]
	quest.3142A26AD2636D61.title: "Build a Working Aquarium"
	quest.3142A26AD2636D61.quest_desc: ["Assemble a functioning tank before adding rare fish."]
	quest.7A6C0BE8F3E42F52.title: "Display a Tide Catch"
	quest.7A6C0BE8F3E42F52.quest_desc: ["Bring a live Tide fish home in a bucket and add it to an aquarium."]

	quest.38FF4CD992D8B3D9.title: "Chef's Delight"
	quest.38FF4CD992D8B3D9.quest_desc: ["Browse Chef's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.73421596ED9374BE.title: "Crate Delight"
	quest.73421596ED9374BE.quest_desc: ["Browse Crate Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.1344F2841723F787.title: "Miner's Delight"
	quest.1344F2841723F787.quest_desc: ["Browse Miner's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.4AD15B7E62A3F1A6.title: "End's Delight"
	quest.4AD15B7E62A3F1A6.quest_desc: ["Browse End's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.36F6A348B6716640.title: "My Nether's Delight"
	quest.36F6A348B6716640.quest_desc: ["Browse My Nether's Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]
	quest.3A4A0DBD9DA973B7.title: "Storage Delight"
	quest.3A4A0DBD9DA973B7.quest_desc: ["Browse Storage Delight in EMI and make one representative recipe or useful kitchen item."]

	// Phase 5A — Building & Decoration
	chapter.5A1000000000C001.title: "Macaw's Building"
	chapter.5B1000000000C001.title: "Galosphere"
	chapter.5B2000000000C001.title: "Naturalist"
	chapter.5B3000000000C001.title: "Hang Glider"
	chapter.5C1000000000C001.title: "Just Hammers"
	chapter.5C2000000000C001.title: "Immersive Armors"
	chapter.5C3000000000C001.title: "Grappling Hook: Skybound"

	quest.5A10000000000001.title: "Macaw's Building Collection"
	quest.5A10000000000001.quest_desc: ["Macaw's building mods add focused families of architectural pieces. Pick the modules that suit your build; you do not need every material variant."]
	quest.5A10000000000002.title: "Bridges"
	quest.5A10000000000002.quest_desc: ["Try a piece from Macaw's Bridges. Bridge parts are useful for paths, rail crossings and industrial catwalks without forcing everything onto full blocks."]
	quest.5A10000000000003.title: "Doors"
	quest.5A10000000000003.quest_desc: ["Try a door from Macaw's Doors. Use EMI to browse the material and style families before committing to a build palette."]
	quest.5A10000000000004.title: "Fences & Walls"
	quest.5A10000000000004.quest_desc: ["Try a piece from Macaw's Fences & Walls. These are especially useful when vanilla fence shapes are too limited for detailed builds."]
	quest.5A10000000000005.title: "Paintings"
	quest.5A10000000000005.quest_desc: ["Try a decorative piece from Macaw's Paintings. This branch is optional decoration rather than progression-critical content."]
	quest.5A10000000000006.title: "Roofs"
	quest.5A10000000000006.quest_desc: ["Try a roof piece. Roof modules provide slopes, ridges and matching trim that are much easier to shape than stair-only roofs."]
	quest.5A10000000000007.title: "Stairs & Balconies"
	quest.5A10000000000007.quest_desc: ["Try a piece from Macaw's Stairs. Use balconies, railings and alternate stair shapes to add depth to facades and interiors."]
	quest.5A10000000000008.title: "Trapdoors"
	quest.5A10000000000008.quest_desc: ["Try a Macaw's Trapdoor. The module provides many visual styles while preserving the familiar trapdoor interaction."]
	quest.5A10000000000009.title: "Windows"
	quest.5A10000000000009.quest_desc: ["Try a Macaw's Window. Windows provide framed and styled alternatives to plain glass panes for finished buildings."]
	quest.5A1000000000000A.title: "Architectural Toolkit"
	quest.5A1000000000000A.quest_desc: ["You have sampled the major Macaw's construction families. Mix them as needed instead of treating this page as a collection checklist."]

	quest.5A20000000000001.title: "Immersive Furniture"
	quest.5A20000000000001.quest_desc: ["Try something from Immersive Furniture. It complements Another Furniture and Handcrafted with another set of interior-building options."]
	quest.5A20000000000002.title: "Furnished Interior"
	quest.5A20000000000002.quest_desc: ["Combine pieces from Another Furniture, Handcrafted and Immersive Furniture into a finished room. The goal is to learn the available palettes, not to collect every chair."]

	// Phase 5B — Adventure & Exploration
\tquest.5B10000000000001.title: "Allurite"
\tquest.5B10000000000001.quest_desc: ["Bring back an Allurite Shard from Galosphere's underground content. Crystal resources are the first concrete sign that you have entered its cave progression."]
\tquest.5B10000000000002.title: "Pink Salt Caves"
\tquest.5B10000000000002.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Pink Salt Shard. Pink Salt caves have their own materials, blocks and inhabitants, so this branch rewards actually exploring them."]
\tquest.5B10000000000003.title: "Palladium"
\tquest.5B10000000000003.quest_desc: ["Process or obtain a Palladium Ingot. Palladium is one of Galosphere's important progression materials and unlocks several crafted mechanics."]
\tquest.5B10000000000004.title: "Opal"
\tquest.5B10000000000004.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Opal while exploring Galosphere. Keep it alongside your other cave finds and inspect its recipes and uses in EMI."]
\tquest.5B10000000000005.title: "Echo Altar"
\tquest.5B10000000000005.quest_desc: ["Craft or obtain an Echo Altar. This is a concrete later-stage Galosphere milestone rather than another informational stop."]
\tquest.5B10000000000006.title: "Sterling Equipment"
\tquest.5B10000000000006.quest_desc: ["Craft a Sterling Chestplate to finish the page with usable Galosphere equipment built from your exploration progress."]

\tquest.5B20000000000001.title: "A More Natural World"
\tquest.5B20000000000001.quest_desc: ["Obtain any Naturalist item while exploring. This opens the compact progression without turning every animal species into a checklist."]
\tquest.5B20000000000002.title: "Knapsack"
\tquest.5B20000000000002.quest_desc: ["Craft or obtain a Naturalist Knapsack. It gives the page an actual utility milestone instead of asking you to merely acknowledge wildlife."]
\tquest.5B20000000000003.title: "Shellstone"
\tquest.5B20000000000003.quest_desc: ["Obtain Shellstone and inspect its uses in EMI. It is one of Naturalist's distinctive material rewards."]
\tquest.5B20000000000004.title: "Naturalist Field Kit"
\tquest.5B20000000000004.quest_desc: ["Collect at least two Naturalist items. The goal is to engage with the mod's useful drops and equipment while you encounter its wildlife naturally."]
\tquest.5B20000000000005.title: "Field Naturalist"
\tquest.5B20000000000005.quest_desc: ["Finish with both a Knapsack and Shellstone in hand. This verifies that you completed the useful-item branches without requiring every animal or drop."]

\tquest.5B30000000000001.title: "Glider Wing"
\tquest.5B30000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft a Glider Wing, the main component used to build your first Hang Glider."]
\tquest.5B30000000000002.title: "Hang Glider"
\tquest.5B30000000000002.quest_desc: ["Craft a Hang Glider. Once you have it, launch from a safe hill or structure and learn how altitude converts into travel distance."]
\tquest.5B30000000000003.title: "Reinforced Hang Glider"
\tquest.5B30000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the Reinforced Hang Glider upgrade. It is the tangible equipment milestone for longer or more dependable aerial travel."]
\tquest.5B30000000000004.title: "Cross-Country Glide"
\tquest.5B30000000000004.quest_desc: ["Use your reinforced glider on a real journey—from a mountain, tower or airship—and land safely. This stays manual because the flight itself is the point."]

	// Phase 5C — Combat & Equipment
\tquest.5C10000000000001.title: "3×3×1 Iron Hammer"
\tquest.5C10000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Hammer. The base hammer mines a 3×3 area one block deep, making it the safest place to learn how Just Hammers chooses its mining plane."]
\tquest.5C10000000000002.title: "3×3×3 Impact Hammer"
\tquest.5C10000000000002.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Impact Hammer. This expands the cut to 3×3×3, trading precision for much faster tunnel and room excavation."]
\tquest.5C10000000000003.title: "5×5 Reinforced Hammer"
\tquest.5C10000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Reinforced Hammer for a broad 5×5 cut one block deep. It is useful for clearing walls and flattening large surfaces."]
\tquest.5C10000000000004.title: "5×5×3 Reinforced Impact Hammer"
\tquest.5C10000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Reinforced Impact Hammer. Its 5×5×3 volume is large enough that positioning matters around machines, veins and decorated builds."]
\tquest.5C10000000000005.title: "5×5×5 Destructor Hammer"
\tquest.5C10000000000005.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Destructor Hammer to unlock the full 5×5×5 excavation pattern. Use it deliberately: one swing removes a substantial volume."]
\tquest.5C10000000000006.title: "Diamond Destructor Hammer"
\tquest.5C10000000000006.quest_desc: ["Upgrade the largest hammer to diamond. This is the practical high-durability bulk-excavation milestone before optional Netherite investment."]

\tquest.5C20000000000001.title: "Wooden Armor"
\tquest.5C20000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft the full Wooden Armor set—helmet, chestplate, leggings and boots. It is an inexpensive introduction to Immersive Armors and makes the set-based progression explicit."]
\tquest.5C20000000000002.title: "Heavy Armor"
\tquest.5C20000000000002.quest_desc: ["Craft the full Heavy Armor set. Heavy Armor is the straightforward high-protection branch and a useful contrast with the more specialized sets."]
\tquest.5C20000000000003.title: "Slime Armor"
\tquest.5C20000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the full Slime Armor set. This branch represents Immersive Armors' more unusual effect-driven equipment rather than vanilla stat progression."]
\tquest.5C20000000000004.title: "Divine Armor"
\tquest.5C20000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft the full Divine Armor set. Divine equipment sits deeper in the crafting progression and is a good milestone for the mod's stronger specialized gear."]
\tquest.5C20000000000005.title: "Steampunk Armor"
\tquest.5C20000000000005.quest_desc: ["Craft the full Steampunk Armor set. Use EMI to inspect its recipes and compare its effects with the other complete sets you have built."]
\tquest.5C20000000000006.title: "Wither Armor"
\tquest.5C20000000000006.quest_desc: ["Craft the full Wither Armor set after completing the earlier branches. This gives the page a tangible late-game equipment endpoint instead of a manual completion button."]

\tquest.5C30000000000001.title: "Skybound Grappling Hook"
\tquest.5C30000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft the basic Grappling Hook. Skybound turns terrain and moving structures into traversal tools, so the page starts with the actual equipment rather than a reading quest."]
\tquest.5C30000000000002.title: "Swing, Reel, Release"
\tquest.5C30000000000002.quest_desc: ["Use the hook enough to learn the core movement loop: attach, build a swing, reel or adjust distance, then release with momentum. This is intentionally a manual interaction milestone."]
\tquest.5C30000000000003.title: "Motor Upgrade"
\tquest.5C30000000000003.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Motor Upgrade and apply it through Skybound's Smithing Table upgrade system when you are ready to change how the hook moves."]
\tquest.5C30000000000004.title: "Rocket Upgrade"
\tquest.5C30000000000004.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Rocket Upgrade. Test high-acceleration upgrades somewhere open before relying on them around cliffs, machinery or valuable builds."]
\tquest.5C30000000000005.title: "Dual Hook Upgrade"
\tquest.5C30000000000005.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Double Hook Upgrade. This gives the upgrade branch another concrete item instead of simply asking you to read about advanced hooks."]
\tquest.5C30000000000006.title: "Long Fall Boots"
\tquest.5C30000000000006.quest_desc: ["Obtain Long Fall Boots. Grappling becomes much more forgiving when a failed release or missed attachment does not turn into lethal fall damage."]
\tquest.5C30000000000007.title: "Advanced Upgrades"
\tquest.5C30000000000007.quest_desc: ["Obtain both a Magnet Upgrade and a Forcefield Upgrade. These demonstrate that Skybound's progression extends beyond basic reel and propulsion changes."]
\tquest.5C30000000000008.title: "Hook a Create Contraption"
\tquest.5C30000000000008.quest_desc: ["Successfully attach your grappling hook to an assembled moving Create contraption. FTB Quests cannot reliably detect this attachment state, so this remains a manual milestone."]
\tquest.5C30000000000009.title: "Board an Airship"
\tquest.5C30000000000009.quest_desc: ["Use the grappling hook on a Sable / Create Aeronautics airship or sublevel and board it safely. This is deliberately manual because the moving-structure interaction is the achievement."]
\tquest.5C3000000000000A.title: "Skybound Arsenal"
\tquest.5C3000000000000A.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Ender Staff Upgrade and a Hook Thrower Upgrade after mastering moving structures. This gives the page a concrete advanced-equipment endpoint."]

	chapter.5F7000000000C001.title: "RPG End Game"
	quest.5E00000000000001.title: "Spell Binding"
	quest.5E00000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft a Spell Binding Table. It is the core workstation for creating and developing RPG Series spell books."]
	quest.5E00000000000002.title: "Choose a Path"
	quest.5E00000000000002.quest_desc: ["Unlock the RPG Series class-selection advancement. All class branches share this radial page, so you can pursue one role or several from the same hub."]
	quest.5E00000000000003.title: "Runic Materials"
	quest.5E00000000000003.quest_desc: ["Collect Arcane, Fire, Frost, and Healing Stones. These runes support several RPG spell and equipment recipes."]
	quest.5E00000000000004.title: "Six Gemstones"
	quest.5E00000000000004.quest_desc: ["Find all six Jewelry gemstones: Ruby, Topaz, Citrine, Jade, Sapphire, and Tanzanite."]
	quest.5E00000000000005.title: "Jeweler's Kit"
	quest.5E00000000000005.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Jeweler's Kit, a Ruby Ring, and a Sapphire Necklace to establish the basic Jewelry progression."]
	quest.5E00000000000006.title: "Orb of Oblivion"
	quest.5E00000000000006.quest_desc: ["Obtain an Orb of Oblivion. It can reset points spent in the class Skill Tree, so keep one before committing deeply to a build."]
	quest.5E00000000000007.title: "Spend a Skill Point"
	quest.5E00000000000007.quest_desc: ["Open the class Skill Tree and spend your first point. FTB Quests cannot reliably inspect Skill Tree state, so this interaction is the one manual onboarding milestone."]
	quest.5F10000000000001.title: "A Proper Bow"
	quest.5F10000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft a Composite Longbow to begin the Archer equipment path."]
	quest.5F10000000000002.title: "Path of Archery"
	quest.5F10000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create the Archery Manual and complete the RPG Series Archer path advancement."]
	quest.5F10000000000003.title: "Archer Armor"
	quest.5F10000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Archer armor set: hood, tunic, leggings, and boots."]
	quest.5F10000000000004.title: "Ranger Armor"
	quest.5F10000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Ranger armor set for the stronger pre-end-game Archer equipment tier."]
	quest.5F10000000000005.title: "Battle Quiver"
	quest.5F10000000000005.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Large Quiver so your ranged build has substantial carried ammunition."]
	quest.5F10000000000006.title: "Ballistics Expert"
	quest.5F10000000000006.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Archery Manual and complete the Archer mastery advancement."]
	quest.5F20000000000001.title: "Tools of the Trade"
	quest.5F20000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Dagger and Iron Sickle to begin the Rogue path."]
	quest.5F20000000000002.title: "Path of Tricks"
	quest.5F20000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create the Rogue Handbook and complete the Rogue path advancement."]
	quest.5F20000000000003.title: "Rogue Armor"
	quest.5F20000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Rogue armor set."]
	quest.5F20000000000004.title: "Assassin Armor"
	quest.5F20000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Assassin armor set as your stronger Rogue specialization gear."]
	quest.5F20000000000005.title: "Diamond Blades"
	quest.5F20000000000005.quest_desc: ["Upgrade to a Diamond Dagger and Diamond Sickle."]
	quest.5F20000000000006.title: "Master of Deception"
	quest.5F20000000000006.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Rogue Handbook and complete the Rogue mastery advancement."]
	quest.5F30000000000001.title: "Heavy Weapons"
	quest.5F30000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Double Axe and Iron Glaive to begin the Warrior path."]
	quest.5F30000000000002.title: "Path of Strength"
	quest.5F30000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create the Warrior's Codex and complete the Warrior path advancement."]
	quest.5F30000000000003.title: "Warrior Armor"
	quest.5F30000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Warrior armor set."]
	quest.5F30000000000004.title: "Berserker Armor"
	quest.5F30000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Berserker armor set for a more aggressive Warrior build."]
	quest.5F30000000000005.title: "Diamond Arsenal"
	quest.5F30000000000005.quest_desc: ["Upgrade to a Diamond Double Axe and Diamond Glaive."]
	quest.5F30000000000006.title: "Rampage"
	quest.5F30000000000006.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Warrior's Codex and complete the Warrior mastery advancement."]
	quest.5F40000000000001.title: "Mace and Shield"
	quest.5F40000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft an Iron Mace and Iron Kite Shield to begin the Paladin path."]
	quest.5F40000000000002.title: "Path of the Paladin"
	quest.5F40000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create the Paladin Libram and complete the Paladin path advancement."]
	quest.5F40000000000003.title: "Paladin Armor"
	quest.5F40000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Paladin armor set."]
	quest.5F40000000000004.title: "Crusader Armor"
	quest.5F40000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Crusader armor set, the basis for Paladin Armory upgrades later."]
	quest.5F40000000000005.title: "Sacred Heavy Weapons"
	quest.5F40000000000005.quest_desc: ["Craft a Diamond Great Hammer and Diamond Claymore."]
	quest.5F40000000000006.title: "Judgement Time"
	quest.5F40000000000006.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Paladin Libram and complete the Paladin mastery advancement."]
	quest.5F50000000000001.title: "Holy Implements"
	quest.5F50000000000001.quest_desc: ["Craft a Holy Wand and Holy Staff to begin the Priest path."]
	quest.5F50000000000002.title: "Path of the Priest"
	quest.5F50000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create the Holy Book and complete the Priest path advancement."]
	quest.5F50000000000003.title: "Priest Vestments"
	quest.5F50000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Priest robe set."]
	quest.5F50000000000004.title: "Prior Vestments"
	quest.5F50000000000004.quest_desc: ["Craft the complete Prior robe set, the basis for Priest Armory upgrades later."]
	quest.5F50000000000005.title: "Diamond Holy Implements"
	quest.5F50000000000005.quest_desc: ["Craft a Diamond Holy Wand and Diamond Holy Staff."]
	quest.5F50000000000006.title: "Servant of the Ori"
	quest.5F50000000000006.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Holy Book and complete the Priest mastery advancement."]
	quest.5F60000000000001.title: "Apprentice Wizard"
	quest.5F60000000000001.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Novice Wand and craft the complete Wizard robe set before specializing."]
	quest.5F60000000000002.title: "Arcane School"
	quest.5F60000000000002.quest_desc: ["Create the Tome of Arcane and choose the Arcane Wizard path."]
	quest.5F60000000000003.title: "Arcane Equipment"
	quest.5F60000000000003.quest_desc: ["Craft an Arcane Staff and the complete Arcane robe set."]
	quest.5F60000000000004.title: "Mind Mastery"
	quest.5F60000000000004.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Tome of Arcane and complete Arcane mastery."]
	quest.5F60000000000005.title: "Fire School"
	quest.5F60000000000005.quest_desc: ["Create the Tome of Fire and choose the Fire Wizard path."]
	quest.5F60000000000006.title: "Fire Equipment"
	quest.5F60000000000006.quest_desc: ["Craft a Fire Staff and the complete Fire robe set."]
	quest.5F60000000000007.title: "Pyromaniac"
	quest.5F60000000000007.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Tome of Fire and complete Fire mastery."]
	quest.5F60000000000008.title: "Frost School"
	quest.5F60000000000008.quest_desc: ["Create the Tome of Frost and choose the Frost Wizard path."]
	quest.5F60000000000009.title: "Frost Equipment"
	quest.5F60000000000009.quest_desc: ["Craft a Frost Staff and the complete Frost robe set."]
	quest.5F6000000000000A.title: "Icy Veins"
	quest.5F6000000000000A.quest_desc: ["Fully bind the Tome of Frost and complete Frost mastery."]
	quest.5F70000000000001.title: "Epic Armor Upgrades"
	quest.5F70000000000001.quest_desc: ["Defeat any major boss from the Boss Progression page, then obtain the Armory epic Smithing Template. End-game class armor uses this template together with class-group upgrade crystals."]
	quest.5F70000000000002.title: "Vanquisher Crystal"
	quest.5F70000000000002.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Vanquisher's Lost Crystal for Archer and Frost Wizard armor upgrades."]
	quest.5F70000000000003.title: "Champion Crystal"
	quest.5F70000000000003.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Champion's Lost Crystal for Rogue and Warrior armor upgrades."]
	quest.5F70000000000004.title: "Redeemer Crystal"
	quest.5F70000000000004.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Redeemer's Lost Crystal for Paladin and Priest armor upgrades."]
	quest.5F70000000000005.title: "Conqueror Crystal"
	quest.5F70000000000005.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Conqueror's Lost Crystal for Arcane and Fire Wizard armor upgrades."]
	quest.5F70000000000006.title: "Strider Set"
	quest.5F70000000000006.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Strider armor set, the Archer Armory milestone."]
	quest.5F70000000000007.title: "Glacier Set"
	quest.5F70000000000007.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Glacier robe set for Frost Wizard end-game equipment."]
	quest.5F70000000000008.title: "Rimeweave Set"
	quest.5F70000000000008.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Rimeweave robe set as the alternate Frost Wizard end-game path."]
	quest.5F70000000000009.title: "Deathmantle Set"
	quest.5F70000000000009.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Deathmantle armor set for Rogue end-game equipment."]
	quest.5F7000000000000A.title: "Onslaught Set"
	quest.5F7000000000000A.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Onslaught armor set for Warrior end-game equipment."]
	quest.5F7000000000000B.title: "Justicar Set"
	quest.5F7000000000000B.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Justicar armor set for one Paladin end-game path."]
	quest.5F7000000000000C.title: "Lightbringer Set"
	quest.5F7000000000000C.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Lightbringer armor set for the alternate Paladin end-game path."]
	quest.5F7000000000000D.title: "Avatar Set"
	quest.5F7000000000000D.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Avatar robe set for one Priest end-game path."]
	quest.5F7000000000000E.title: "Absolution Set"
	quest.5F7000000000000E.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Absolution robe set for the alternate Priest end-game path."]
	quest.5F7000000000000F.title: "Tempest Set"
	quest.5F7000000000000F.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Tempest robe set for one Arcane Wizard end-game path."]
	quest.5F70000000000010.title: "Astral Set"
	quest.5F70000000000010.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Astral robe set for the alternate Arcane Wizard end-game path."]
	quest.5F70000000000011.title: "Scarlet Set"
	quest.5F70000000000011.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Scarlet robe set for one Fire Wizard end-game path."]
	quest.5F70000000000012.title: "Smouldering Set"
	quest.5F70000000000012.quest_desc: ["Upgrade into the complete Smouldering robe set for the alternate Fire Wizard end-game path."]
	quest.5F70000000000013.title: "Legendary Ranged Weapons"
	quest.5F70000000000013.quest_desc: ["Find both a unique Arsenal longbow and heavy crossbow. Arsenal equipment is loot-driven rather than a crafting checklist."]
	quest.5F70000000000014.title: "Legendary Agile Weapons"
	quest.5F70000000000014.quest_desc: ["Find representative unique Arsenal weapons for fast melee builds: a dagger and double axe."]
	quest.5F70000000000015.title: "Legendary Heavy Weapons"
	quest.5F70000000000015.quest_desc: ["Find a unique Arsenal mace and shield for heavy frontline builds."]
	quest.5F70000000000016.title: "Legendary Staves"
	quest.5F70000000000016.quest_desc: ["Find both damage-oriented and healing-oriented unique Arsenal staves."]
	quest.5F70000000000017.title: "Rare Agile Jewelry"
	quest.5F70000000000017.quest_desc: ["Find rare Jewelry pieces suited to Archer and Rogue-style builds."]
	quest.5F70000000000018.title: "Rare Frontline Jewelry"
	quest.5F70000000000018.quest_desc: ["Find rare tank and healing Jewelry pieces."]
	quest.5F70000000000019.title: "Rare Mage Jewelry"
	quest.5F70000000000019.quest_desc: ["Find rare Arcane, Fire, and Frost Jewelry pieces."]
	quest.5F7000000000001A.title: "Dungeon Relics"
	quest.5F7000000000001A.quest_desc: ["Find a Holy Locket and Ender's Hand from Relics. These are acquisition milestones for dungeon and high-value loot."]
	quest.5F7000000000001B.title: "Relic Hunter"
	quest.5F7000000000001B.quest_desc: ["Find a Bastion Ring and Elytra Booster to complete the representative Relics branch."]
	chapter.507000000000C001.title: "Boss Progression"
	quest.5071000000000001.title: "The Wither"
	quest.5071000000000001.quest_desc: ["Defeat the Wither and claim its Nether Star. This is a real progression gate for Create Nuclear's Reactor Controller rather than an arbitrary boss-chain requirement."]
	quest.5071000000000002.title: "Remastered Ender Dragon"
	quest.5071000000000002.quest_desc: ["Defeat the Ender Dragon. Ender Dragon Fight Remastered changes the encounter, but the boss remains the vanilla Ender Dragon entity so FTB Quests can track the kill directly."]
	quest.5072000000000001.title: "Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.5072000000000001.quest_desc: ["Defeat a Ferrous Wroughtnaut and recover both guaranteed trophies: the Wrought Helm and Axe of a Thousand Metals."]
	quest.5072000000000002.title: "Frostmaw"
	quest.5072000000000002.quest_desc: ["Defeat a Frostmaw. Its native Mowzie's Mobs advancement is used for reliable completion; the Ice Crystal is deliberately not mandatory because it can be stolen before the kill."]
	quest.5072000000000003.title: "Umvuthi, the Sunbird"
	quest.5072000000000003.quest_desc: ["Defeat Umvuthi and claim the Sol Visage. The visage is a guaranteed player-kill drop and makes a concrete trophy for this encounter."]
	quest.5073000000000001.title: "Cloud Golem"
	quest.5073000000000001.quest_desc: ["Defeat the Cloud Golem using Legendary Monsters' native boss advancement, then recover its guaranteed Air Rune and Atmospheric Boots."]
	quest.5073000000000002.title: "Possessed Paladin"
	quest.5073000000000002.quest_desc: ["Defeat the Possessed Paladin in the Collapsed Kingdom progression, then recover its guaranteed Corrupted Soul and Soul Great Sword."]
	quest.5073000000000003.title: "The Obliterator"
	quest.5073000000000003.quest_desc: ["Defeat The Obliterator, the late Legendary Monsters boss associated with the Space Station progression, and recover a Portal Shard. It is shown as an outer-tier encounter without hard-gating the other Legendary bosses behind it."]
	quest.5074000000000001.title: "Mother of the Maze"
	quest.5074000000000001.quest_desc: ["After reaching the Ship Graveyard, defeat the Maze Mother and obtain a Maze Rose. The Adventure page owns discovery; the Bosses page owns the actual kill."]
	quest.5074000000000002.title: "Captain Cornelia"
	quest.5074000000000002.quest_desc: ["Obtain the Shell Horn through Aquamirae progression, use it to reach Captain Cornelia, then defeat her. Her follow-up equipment remains on the Aquamirae page."]
	quest.5074000000000003.title: "Kraken"
	quest.5074000000000003.quest_desc: ["After discovering signs of the Kraken on the Myths of the Sea page, defeat one and recover its guaranteed Kraken Tentacle."]
	quest.5074000000000004.title: "Leviathan"
	quest.5074000000000004.quest_desc: ["Track a Leviathan through the Myths of the Sea discovery branch, defeat it, and recover its guaranteed Leviathan Heart."]
}
